\subsection{Method \code{requiredMethods()}}{
Lists the method names required by the \code{RSEncoding} protocol.

Conforming classes must implement both:
\itemize{
\item \code{objectsForEncoding()}: defines the child objects to encode
\item \code{resolveClassWith(new_cls)}: enables class reassignment on decoding
}
